# intro-play: INTRO.EXE as START1.EXE runs it ("3 4 0 homie"), no keys. The intro plays for 147 s of
# virtual time, then INTRO loads EOB.EXE into its own memory (DOS 4B03h) with the command line
# " 3 4 0 homie 3 0" and jumps to it (whitepaper 2.6); EOB.EXE shows its title menu.
option program INTRO.EXE
option insns 175000000
wait 300
shot present
wait 500
shot waterdeep
wait 900
shot middle
wait 700
shot late
wait 600
shot title
quit
